\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  O, Jesus my joyous hope
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and all things that in my soul;
\par you are more than all my friends
\par I thank you all my life days
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. How can I give you your praise
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 for the great gift you gave me
\par to strengthen me in my faith
\par that mine befit your praises?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Your suffering and your great pain
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to the fountain of my life
\par Your weeping and Your sorrow
\par shall make me give all my thanks.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  For this love, I give my thanks
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 that made you to be strengthened
\par and you were not discouraged
\par till You gave your life for me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   I'll forever remember
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 the life manna from Heaven
\par for that which I eat today
\par I shall always give you thanks.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Those sinful acts that grips me
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 gracefully take them away
\par cleanse me from within my heart
\par and make it always your home.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  O take my soul and body
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 attach it to you always
\par You are my great protector
\par in you I shall always dwell.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  So I shall not go rotten
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 that, peacefully I shall die;
\par and Jesus, shall wake me up
\par \pard      and let me see your face there.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

